----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       ADXL345-FreeFall-Demo.spin2
    Description:    Demo of the ADXL345 driver
        * Free-fall detection functionality
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Nov 12, 2021
